# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# skdm-turkiye — .gitignore
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Local working journal -------------------------------------------------
# MEMORY.md is a private, machine-local development log: what was done in what
# order, which decisions were taken, and which approaches were tried and
# abandoned. Deliberately NOT tracked — it never reaches GitHub, Zenodo or JOSS.
# The tracked companions are STATUS.md (current state) and ROADMAP.md
# (decisions and open questions).
MEMORY.md

# --- Generated validation reports -------------------------------------------
# pointblank writes a ~200 KB self-contained HTML report with inline CSS/JS and
# a fresh timestamp on every run. Tracking it would churn git history on each
# pipeline execution for no benefit. The tracked evidence is the CSV and
# Markdown output in data/processed/; the gate itself is enforced in code.
data/processed/*_validation.html

# --- Raw source data -------------------------------------------------------
# Reproducibility comes from the fetch scripts in scripts/, not from committed
# binaries (CLAUDE.md §8.6). Processed outputs ARE tracked so the app runs on
# a fresh clone without re-running the full ETL.
data/raw/
!data/raw/.gitkeep

# --- R session artefacts ---------------------------------------------------
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
.RData
.Rproj.user/
.Ruserdata/
*.Rproj
.Renviron
.Rprofile.local

# Compiled / knitr side effects
*.o
*.so
*.dll
*_cache/
/cache/
*.utf8.md
*.knit.md

# --- renv ------------------------------------------------------------------
# renv.lock and renv/activate.R MUST stay tracked — they are the reproducibility
# contract. The library itself must not be.
renv/library/
renv/local/
renv/cellar/
renv/lock/
renv/python/
renv/sandbox/
renv/staging/

# --- Shiny / deployment ----------------------------------------------------
rsconnect/

# --- Secrets ---------------------------------------------------------------
# API keys for source platforms must never enter history.
.env
*.pem
*_secret*
*_token*

# --- OS noise --------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Editors ---------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
